{"unit_id":"TAOxxx7__dsh-plugin-manager#card-1","repo":"TAOxxx7/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e7afe54dd1a54c546e9e0b3c6dcc910d4f48c251","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin Manager 是面向 DSH Desktop 和原生 Web profile 的设置插件管理器。它在“设置 → 插件”中展示已安装包，按类别分组并支持搜索；也可从 GitHub 的 dsh-plugin 主题发现市场插件。用户可以安装 npm 或 GitHub 插件、查看重复安装信息、卸载插件、检查更新并升级单个或全部包。安装遇到构建许可提示时可确认后重试，成功安装后界面会询问是否重启。Host 按当前 profile 执行包管理操作，适合希望从 DSH 设置界面维护插件的用户；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:985-1019","lib/index.js:1044-1073","lib/client.js:4967-5049"]}
{"unit_id":"TAOxxx7__dsh-plugin-manager#card-2","repo":"TAOxxx7/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e7afe54dd1a54c546e9e0b3c6dcc910d4f48c251","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Plugin Manager adds a Settings tab to manage DSH plugins. It groups and filters installed packages, searches the GitHub dsh-plugin market, installs or removes packages, and checks or applies updates. It retries after build approval and offers a restart. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:985-1019","lib/index.js:1044-1073","lib/client.js:4967-5049"]}
