{"unit_id":"TAOxxx7__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-1","repo":"TAOxxx7/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e7afe54dd1a54c546e9e0b3c6dcc910d4f48c251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin Manager 的功能「插件清单与分类」：在设置插件页列出当前 profile 已安装的包，按类别分组并可按名称筛选。用户通过设置页的搜索框和类别选择器浏览清单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4972-5048"]}
{"unit_id":"TAOxxx7__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-2","repo":"TAOxxx7/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e7afe54dd1a54c546e9e0b3c6dcc910d4f48c251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin Manager 的功能「插件市场」：搜索 GitHub 上带 dsh-plugin 主题的仓库，优先安装其 npm 包；没有 npm 包时可从 GitHub 安装。用户在市场区搜索并确认。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:988-1019","lib/client.js:5050-5085"]}
{"unit_id":"TAOxxx7__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-3","repo":"TAOxxx7/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e7afe54dd1a54c546e9e0b3c6dcc910d4f48c251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin Manager 的功能「卸载与升级」：用户可从已安装插件卡片发起卸载或单包升级，也可触发检查并更新插件。操作后 Host 返回新的插件清单和命令输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1044-1056","lib/index.js:1071-1073"]}
{"unit_id":"TAOxxx7__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-4","repo":"TAOxxx7/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e7afe54dd1a54c546e9e0b3c6dcc910d4f48c251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin Manager 的功能「构建许可重试与重启提示」：安装返回构建许可键时，用户可确认该键并重试；市场安装成功后界面提供重启当前 profile 的提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1021-1042","lib/client.js:4861-4880"]}
{"unit_id":"TAOxxx7__dsh-plugin-manager#caveat-1","repo":"TAOxxx7/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e7afe54dd1a54c546e9e0b3c6dcc910d4f48c251","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin Manager 使用前须知：市场搜索会将查询词发送给 GitHub；还会查询 npm 元数据或从 codeload 获取源码包。见 lib/index.js:989-1002、lib/index.js:551-582。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:989-1002","lib/index.js:551-582"]}
{"unit_id":"TAOxxx7__dsh-plugin-manager#caveat-2","repo":"TAOxxx7/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e7afe54dd1a54c546e9e0b3c6dcc910d4f48c251","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin Manager 使用前须知：包操作会用 pnpm 修改当前 profile；Web profile 需本机有 pnpm。见 lib/index.js:1044-1056、lib/index.js:1323-1418。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1044-1056","lib/index.js:1323-1418"]}
